THE BRAIN NEVER FORGETS — third-party material

MUSIC
- Frédéric Chopin, Nocturne in E-flat major, Op. 9 No. 2 (composition: public domain).
  Recording: Aya Higuchi (piano), "Musopen – The Complete Works of Frédéric Chopin" (Musopen Kickstarter project, 2012),
  dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0. Source: https://archive.org/details/musopen-chopin-complete-works-flac
  (file "Nocturne in E flat major, Op. 9 no. 2.flac"). Used from the opening for about 28 s, level-ridden for small speakers, ducked under dialogue, faded out at bedtime.
